# sierra-hd: the deterministic mode and kernel-call trace (milestone 4).
#
# With SIERRA_HD_TRACE=<file> set, the SCI engine runs on a virtual clock
# (time passes only where the engine sleeps or waits), drives the music timer
# from that clock, seeds its random source with SIERRA_HD_SEED (default 0),
# runs the date and time from noon on 1990-01-01 on that clock, takes input only from SIERRA_HD_REPLAY
# (docs/formats/replay-and-trace.md), and writes every kernel call with its
# arguments and result to the trace file. SIERRA_HD_STOP_TICK and
# SIERRA_HD_STOP_CALLS end the game. With SIERRA_HD_SCREENS=<folder> (milestone
# 4b) it also writes the screen the player sees there. Used by tools/vm-trace
# to compare sci-vm with ScummVM (engines/sci/sierra_hd_trace.cpp describes
# the details).
